#: usr/share/archlinux-tweak-tool/btrfs_gui.py:143
msgid ""
"Your root filesystem is <b>btrfs</b>, so snapshots can be used on this "
"system.\n"
"These snapshot tools are <b>not on the ISO</b> — install them here, then "
"enable snapshots.\n"
"\n"
"How it works: a snapshot pair is taken on every <b>pacman</b> action (via "
"snap-pac);\n"
"<b>no</b> hourly timeline snapshots. Cleanup prunes old pairs automatically."
msgstr ""
"你的根文件系统是 <b>btrfs</b>，因此可以在此系统上使用快照。\n"
"这些快照工具<b>不在 ISO 中</b>：请在此处安装，然后启用快照。\n"
"\n"
"工作方式：每次 <b>pacman</b> 操作都会（通过 snap-pac）创建一对快照；\n"
"<b>不会</b>创建每小时的时间线快照。清理功能会自动清除旧的快照对。"

#: usr/share/archlinux-tweak-tool/btrfs_gui.py:152
msgid ""
"Btrfs snapshots let you roll the system back after an update breaks "
"something.\n"
"This page needs a <b>btrfs</b> root filesystem — see <b>Status</b> below.\n"
"\n"
"Where it is available: a snapshot pair is taken on every <b>pacman</b> "
"action\n"
"(via snap-pac); <b>no</b> hourly timeline snapshots, and cleanup prunes old "
"pairs."
msgstr ""
"Btrfs 快照可让你在更新导致问题后回滚系统。\n"
"此页面需要 <b>btrfs</b> 根文件系统，请参阅下方的<b>状态</b>。\n"
"\n"
"适用情况：每次 <b>pacman</b> 操作都会（通过 snap-pac）创建一对快照；\n"
"<b>不会</b>创建每小时的时间线快照，并且会清除旧的快照对。"

